    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Toy Shop Simulator&quot; lets you manage a toy store. Organize shelves, help customers, and expand your shop in a fun, playful world. Join our Discord to connect with other players and share your toy shop experiences! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/38b496be19104150ba129dda29cc8528.avif?t=1747472204\" width=640 height=73 /></span>Create the ultimate toy empire from the ground up. Design, manage, and grow your dream toy shop in a bustling city where your creativity and strategy will lead to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/47357ef28b5b51cb0a0e2c2e30be7058.poster.avif?t=1747472204\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/47357ef28b5b51cb0a0e2c2e30be7058.webm?t=1747472204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/47357ef28b5b51cb0a0e2c2e30be7058.mp4?t=1747472204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/cbf9415c73d24364281ac8598eb318f5.avif?t=1747472204\" width=640 height=73 /></span>Arrange toys on shelves, optimize store layout for aesthetics and efficiency, and create an inviting shopping experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/9678c414c11fa9e4210a95268916b015.poster.avif?t=1747472204\" width=600 h