d.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/3b8b51b0c908cc5fc6b6667ba8546a27.poster.avif?t=1747472204\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/3b8b51b0c908cc5fc6b6667ba8546a27.webm?t=1747472204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/3b8b51b0c908cc5fc6b6667ba8546a27.mp4?t=1747472204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/2516dd25385237ac3dd1fa62d7eba89d.avif?t=1747472204\" width=640 height=73 /></span>Discover special toys to attract more customers and play with legendary ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/78f1870b0ae6fea69eb202250b272976.poster.avif?t=1747472204\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/78f1870b0ae6fea69eb202250b272976.webm?t=1747472204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/78f1870b0ae6fea69eb202250b272976.mp4?t=1747472204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/94d54124d45ff2c337ec40366beda0d9.avif?t=1747472204\" width=640 height=73 /></span>Watch out for thieves trying to steal your toys\u2014catch them before they escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/ec8faffab688ad6f10548c3bfc658726.poster.avif?t=1747472204\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/ec8faffab688ad6f10548c3bfc658726.webm?t=1747472204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163790/extras/ec8faffab688ad6f10548c3bfc658726.mp4?t=1747472204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cleaning Mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > NPC Interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Random Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Banking &amp; Credit Systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shoplifters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Warehouse &amp; Inventory Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Vibrant &amp; Interactive City</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Toy Shop Simulator and build your dream toy store from the ground up!</p>",
